OL,3,GNEWSASir Jim Ratcliffe's Ineos to
OL,4,Amothball three major chemical sites in
OL,5,AHull
OL,6,
OL,7,FBillionaire Sir Jim Ratcliffe's
OL,8,Findustrial giant Ineos is pausing
OL,9,Fproduction at its three sites in Hull,
OL,10,Fblaming high UK gas prices.
OL,12,FIneos has confirmed up to 4,000 jobs
OL,13,Fare affected `1,000 directly and
OL,14,Fanother 3,000 in the supply chain.
OL,16,FThe firm said gas prices in the UK are
OL,17,Ftwelve times higher than in the US, and
OL,18,Feight times more expensive than the
OL,19,Fcoal-based processes used by Chinese
OL,20,Fcompetitors.
